es changed across conversations while remaining hidden from users. - Sandboxing mitigates some damage but may not prevent attackers from accessing other legitimate systems. - The issue adds to broader concerns about AI poisoning and hidden instructions on compromised websites. - NemoClaw targets lo',NULL,NULL,0,1,0,0,'evt_b0ead028-c849-4e','2026-08-27T15:02:42.000Z','2026-08-27 15:02:54','2026-08-27 15:02:54');
